                "description": "This stunning Bristol Clear Crystal Knob with Square Rose combines modern and traditional mediums to make something that is truly beautiful. The Clear Crystal Bristol Ball Knob with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The rosette is available in a wide array of modern finishes including oil rubbed bronze and satin brass. This Crystal Bristol Door Knobset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
